<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-049" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-049-xiqian" source-id="s-nanqishu-049-xiqian-ws2261984">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-xiqian:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">時新蔡太守<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-xiqian:p001:m0005" ref="2d4_2ed_646_A">席謙</persName>，永明中爲中書郎<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-xiqian:p001:m0015" ref="euq_wt7_i8i">王融</persName>所薦。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-xiqian:p001:m0021" ref="2d4_2ed_646">恭穆</persName>，鎮西司馬，爲魚復侯所害。至是<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-xiqian:p001:m0038" ref="2d4_2ed_646_A">謙</persName>鎮盆城，聞義師東下，曰：「我家世忠貞，殞死不二。」爲<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-xiqian:p001:m0065" ref="b59_d2b_609">陳伯之</persName>所殺。</p>
</text>
